    "modifiedAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "kt_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -384
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Kinetic typography\n\nEach character of every row gets its own (x, y). The phrase is split into a Spread<string> and repeated for 40 rows; paired with a Range of the same length, the ForEach visits every (row, character). Inside, floor / mod recover the row and character index: the row sets y, and x is the character's offset from the middle of the phrase plus a sideways sine sway. The sway's phase, 1.6·t + 0.55·char − 0.22·row, sends a wave across the letters and down the rows.\n\nEdit the String node to change the phrase; the grid count rebuilds itself.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 320
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Kinetic typography\n\nEach character of every row gets its own (x, y). The phrase is split into a Spread<string> and repeated for 40 rows; paired with a Range of the same length, the ForEach visits every (row, character). Inside, floor / mod recover the row and character index: the row sets y, and x is the character's offset from the middle of the phrase plus a sideways sine sway. The sway's phase, 1.6·t + 0.55·char − 0.22·row, sends a wave across the letters and down the rows.\n\nEdit the String node to change the phrase; the grid count rebuilds itself.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 320
      }
    },
